{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-pro-3-1","title":"Proverbs 3:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Sundry exhortations. 13 The gain of wisdom. 27 Exhortation to beneficence, etc. 33 The different state of the wicked and upright.</p>\n<p>forget. 1:8; 4:5; 31:5; De 4:23; Ps 119:93,153,176; Ho 4:6 let. De 4:9; 6:6-9; 8:1; 30:16-20; Ps 119:11,16,34,47,48; Isa 51:17 Jer 31:33; Joh 14:21-24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-3-2","title":"Proverbs 3:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>length. 16; 4:10; 9:11; Job 5:26; Ps 34:11-14; 91:16; 128:6; Eph 6:1-3 1Ti 4:8 long life. Heb. years of life. Ps 21:4 and peace. 17; Ps 119:165; Isa 32:17; 57:19-21; Ro 5:1; 14:17; 15:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-3-3","title":"Proverbs 3:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>mercy. 16:6; 20:28; 2Sa 15:20; Ps 25:10; Ho 4:1; Mic 7:18-20; Mal 2:6 Mt 23:23; Eph 5:1,2,9 bind. 6:21; 7:3; Ex 13:9; De 6:8; 11:18-21; Ps 119:11 write. Jer 17:1; 2Co 3:3; Heb 10:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-3-4","title":"Proverbs 3:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>shalt. Ge 39:2-4,21; 1Sa 2:26; Ps 111:10; Da 1:9; Lu 2:52; Ac 2:47 Ro 14:18 good understanding. or, good success. Jos 1:7,8; *marg: Ps 111:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-3-5","title":"Proverbs 3:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>Trust. 22:19; Job 13:15; Ps 37:3,5,7; 62:8; 115:9-11; 125:1; 146:3-5 Isa 12:2; 26:3,4; Jer 17:7,8; Eph 1:12 and. 7; 23:4; 28:26; Jer 9:23; 10:23; Ro 12:16; 1Co 3:18-20; 8:1,2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-3-6","title":"Proverbs 3:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>In. 16:3; 23:17; 1Sa 4:11,12; 30:8; 1Ch 28:9; Ezr 7:27; 8:22,23 Ne 1:11; 2:4; 1Co 10:31; 2Co 8:16; Php 4:6; Col 3:17,23 and. 16:9; Ps 25:8,9; 32:8; Isa 30:21; 48:17; Jer 10:23; Jas 1:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-3-7","title":"Proverbs 3:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>Be. 26:12; Isa 5:21; Ro 11:25; 12:16 fear. 14:27; 16:6; Ne 5:15; Job 1:1; 28:28; Ps 34:11-14; Ec 12:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-3-8","title":"Proverbs 3:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>shall. 4:22; 16:24; Ps 147:3; Isa 1:6; Jer 30:12,13 health. Heb. medicine. thy. Eze 16:4,5 marrow. Heb. watering, or moistening. Job 21:24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-3-9","title":"Proverbs 3:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>14:31; Ge 14:18-21; 28:22; Ex 22:29; 23:19; 34:26; 35:20-29 Nu 7:2-89; 31:50-54; De 26:2-15; Hag 1:4-9; Mal 3:8,9 Mr 14:7,8,10-21; Lu 14:13,14; 1Co 16:2; 2Co 8:2,3,8,9 Php 4:17,18; 1Jo 3:17,18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-3-10","title":"Proverbs 3:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>11:24,25; 19:17; 22:9; Le 26:2-5; De 28:8; Ec 11:1,2; Hag 2:19 Mal 3:10,11; Mt 10:42; 2Co 9:6-11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-3-11","title":"Proverbs 3:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>My. Job 5:17; Ps 94:12; 1Co 11:32; Heb 12:5,6; Re 3:19 neither. 24:10; Job 4:5; Isa 40:30,31; 2Co 4:1,16,17; Heb 12:3,7-12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-3-12","title":"Proverbs 3:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>29:17; De 8:5; Ps 103:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-3-13","title":"Proverbs 3:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>is the. 4:5-9; 8:32-35; 1Ki 10:1-9,23,24; Ec 9:15-18 getteth. Heb. draweth out. 2:4; 18:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-3-14","title":"Proverbs 3:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>2:4; 8:10,11,19; 16:16; 2Ch 1:11,12; Job 28:13-19 Ps 119:72,111,162; Mt 16:26; Php 3:8,9; Re 3:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-3-15","title":"Proverbs 3:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>more. 8:11; 20:15; 31:10; Mt 13:44-46 all. Ps 63:3; 73:25,26; Ro 8:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-3-16","title":"Proverbs 3:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>Length. 2; 4:10; Ps 21:4; 71:9; 1Ti 4:8 and. 4:6-9; 8:18-21; 1Ki 3:13; Mr 10:30; 1Co 3:21-23; 2Co 6:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-3-17","title":"Proverbs 3:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>ways of. 2:10; 22:18; Ps 19:10,11; 63:3-5; 112:1; 119:14,47,103,174 Mt 11:28-30 all. Ps 25:10; 37:11; 119:165; Isa 26:3; 57:19; Lu 1:79; Ro 5:1 Php 4:8,9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-3-18","title":"Proverbs 3:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>11:30; 13:12; Ge 2:9; 3:22; Re 22:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-3-19","title":"Proverbs 3:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>Lord. 8:27-29; Ps 104:24; 136:5; Jer 10:12; 51:15; Joh 1:3 established. or, prepared.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-3-20","title":"Proverbs 3:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>the depths. Ge 1:9; 7:11; Job 38:8-11; Ps 104:8,9 the clouds. Ge 27:28,37-39; De 33:28; Job 36:27,28; 38:26-28; Ps 65:9-12 Jer 14:22; Joe 2:23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-3-21","title":"Proverbs 3:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>let. 1-3; De 4:9; 6:6-9; Jos 1:8; Joh 8:31; 15:6,7; Heb 2:1-3 1Jo 2:24,27 keep. 2:7; De 32:46,47</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-3-22","title":"Proverbs 3:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>life. 4:22; Isa 38:16; Joh 12:49,50 grace. 1:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-3-23","title":"Proverbs 3:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>2:8; 4:12; 10:9; Ps 37:23,24,31; 91:11; 121:3,8; Zec 10:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-3-24","title":"Proverbs 3:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>liest. 6:22; Le 26:6; Ps 3:5; 4:8; 121:4-7; Eze 34:15 and. Ps 127:2; Jer 31:26; Ac 12:6; 1Th 4:13,14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-3-25","title":"Proverbs 3:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>Be. Job 5:21,22; 11:13-15; Ps 27:1,2; 46:1-3; 91:5; 112:7; Isa 8:12,13 Isa 41:10-14; Da 3:17,18; Mt 8:24-26; 24:6; Mr 4:40; Lu 21:9 Joh 14:1; 1Pe 3:14 neither. 1:27; Ps 73:19; Mt 24:15; Lu 21:18-28</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-3-26","title":"Proverbs 3:26","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":26,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":26},"content":"<p>Lord. 14:26; Ps 91:3,9,10; Hab 3:17,18 shall keep. 1Sa 2:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-3-27","title":"Proverbs 3:27","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":27,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":27},"content":"<p>Withhold. Ro 13:7; Ga 6:10; Tit 2:14; Jas 2:15,16; 5:4 them to whom it is due. Heb. the owners thereof. in the. Ge 31:29; Mic 2:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-3-28","title":"Proverbs 3:28","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":28,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":28},"content":"<p>27:1; Le 19:13; De 24:12-15; Ec 9:10; 11:6; 2Co 8:11; 9:3; 1Ti 6:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-3-29","title":"Proverbs 3:29","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":29,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":29},"content":"<p>Devise not evil. or, Practise no evil. 6:14,18; 16:29,30; Ps 35:20; 55:20; 59:3; Jer 18:18-20; Mic 2:1,2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-3-30","title":"Proverbs 3:30","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":30,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":30},"content":"<p>17:14; 18:6; 25:8,9; 29:22; Mt 5:39-41; Ro 12:18-21; 1Co 6:6-8 2Ti 2:24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-3-31","title":"Proverbs 3:31","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":31,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":31},"content":"<p>Envy. 23:17; 24:1,19,20; Ps 37:1,7-9; 73:3; Ga 5:21 the oppressor. Heb. a man of violence. Ec 5:8 choose. 1:15-18; 2:12-15; 12:12; 22:22-25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-3-32","title":"Proverbs 3:32","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":32,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":32},"content":"<p>the froward. 6:6-19; 8:13; 11:20; 17:15; Ps 18:26; Lu 16:15 his. 14:10; Ps 25:14; Mt 11:25; 13:11; Joh 14:21-24; 15:15; Re 2:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-3-33","title":"Proverbs 3:33","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":33,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":33},"content":"<p>curse. 21:12; Le 26:14-46; De 7:26; 28:15-68; 29:19-29; Jos 6:18; 7:13 Ps 37:22; Zec 5:3,4; Mal 2:2 he blesseth. De 28:2-14; 2Sa 6:11; Job 8:6,7; Ps 1:3; 91:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-3-34","title":"Proverbs 3:34","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":34,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":34},"content":"<p>he scorneth. 9:7,8,12; 19:29; 21:24; Ps 138:6 he giveth. Isa 57:15; Jas 4:6; 1Pe 5:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-3-35","title":"Proverbs 3:35","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":35,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":35},"content":"<p>wise. 4:8; 1Sa 2:30; Ps 73:24 but. 13:8; Ps 132:18; Isa 65:13-15; Da 12:2,3 shall be the promotion of fools. Heb. exalteth the fools.</p>"}]}